{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "メリークリスマス🎄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "25日ですね！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クリスマス当日が雨なんて珍しいですよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob8u1Vxu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobdYjzgZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年のクリスマスはこんなにサンタを身に纏った年は初めて！と思うくらいお仕事や各所でクリスマスを満喫できた、いちねんな気がしてすごく嬉しいです✨️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "街は相変わらずきらきらで、\nどこを歩いても音楽と光と、少し甘い匂いがする気がします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "プレゼントみたいな出来事も、\n包み紙はないけど大切にしたい時間も、\n今年は沢山ありました！！\n全部まとめて、今年のクリスマスでした🎁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はメリークリスマス伝えたかったので少し短めです(   ߹ㅁ߹)\n最近急激に寒くなってきたのでみんなあたたかくしてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobVsvkBh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob4VkBXO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クリスマスプレゼントみたい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も、誰かの一日が\nあたたかくなっていますように。\n素敵なクリスマスをお過ごしください🎄💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "佑捺"}], "source": "official"}